<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's  PPI rises 3.9 pct-government.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's  PPI rises 3.9 pct-government.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's producer price index (PPI) rose 3.9 percent in June on the year, up from a 1.6 percent year-on-year rise a year earlier, Ministry of Finance and Economy figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>					   June	May     June '96</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, yr-on-yr)	    +3.9     +3.7	+1.6</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, month-to-month)    +0.2	0.0	 0.0</p>
<p>    PPI (base=1990)		 123.9    123.7     119.3</p>
<p>The ministry said the producer price index (PPI) rose 3.5 percent in 1996, against 3.4 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5645</p>
